        },
        "quote": "(a) The Transportation Operations Superintendent may establish a fine schedule for any time-restricted parking zone violations within the following minimum and maximum ranges:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "0471c269-0ac3-5423-af9e-97d21a70aaab",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 231,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:1",
          "start": 176
        },
        "quote": "(1) Eight dollars and $20.00 for a first violation; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "37ea151b-c362-58f8-9e16-e83aa57e529f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 406,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:2",
          "start": 232
        },
        "quote": "(2) Fifteen dollars and $40.00 for a second violation and all successive violations at the same parking meter, time-restricted parking or block parking zone on the same date.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "ab8b0799-df58-5d53-8d53-a3d4fe706040",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 672,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:3",
          "start": 407
        },
        "quote": "(b) In determining the fine schedule, the Transportation Operations Superintendent will consider the availability of on-street parking, garage and lot parking, parking congestion and any other factors relative to parking operations in the central business district.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b01a9072-d97a-5d5d-a586-0cfbbbd06fd9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 708,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:4",
          "start": 673
        },
        "quote": "(c) Fines shall be paid as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "d5d68b05-6055-5f99-905f-0dffcf894e62",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 769,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:5",
          "start": 709
        },
        "quote": "(1) The amount of the fine, if paid within 14 calendar days.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "54cd63ef-047f-5d6f-8e6a-0b13004c84c1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 849,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:6",
          "start": 770
        },
        "quote": "(2) Double the fine for the same violation after 14 calendar days have elapsed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "2caa4fb0-1fed-55e9-a507-df52aeac71a3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 929,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:7",
          "start": 850
        },
        "quote": "(3) Triple the fine for the same violation after 30 calendar days have elapsed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6fd22841-93a6-577c-81b5-2bf7c30e7af1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1013,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:8",
          "start": 930
        },
        "quote": "(4) Four times the fine for the same violation after 60 calendar days have elapsed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "7b02e200-df5e-59e2-bc6e-b290b137e9cf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1193,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:9",
          "start": 1014
        },
        "quote": "(5) Unpaid fines for parking violations which have been subject to a final determination will be collected, utilizing civil collection process after 75 calendar days have elapsed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "ff94eaf7-8c64-543c-9073-6cd6fa6936b7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1320,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:10",
          "start": 1194
        },
        "quote": "(d) All of the moneys collected for overtime parking and block meter zone violations shall be distributed to the parking fund.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.60.010 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "846f449f-215d-5812-95bb-bb539c5fa43a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1769,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.010:block:11",
          "start": 1321
        },
        "quote": "(e) Notwithstanding the fine schedule set forth in subsection (a) of this section or any other conflicting section contained in this title, the City Manager shall have the authority to waive the enforcement and collection of any time-restricted parking zone violations on such dates and times and at the specific locations that the City Manager shall designate in writing to the Transportation Operations Superintendent. (Ord. 20566 § 10, 6-10-25.)",
